# Moonbase embedded storefront — leave unset to fall back to the local
# AuthContext / CartContext prototype. Once a Moonbase account exists, set
# this to the storefront base URL (no trailing slash) and whitelist this
# site's origins in the Moonbase admin → settings → integration.
#
# For Entropia Audio:
#   VITE_MOONBASE_URL=https://entropiaudio.moonbase.sh
#
# Whitelisted origins must include all of:
#   - https://entropiaudio.com         (prod)
#   - https://superlative-chaja-7af56f.netlify.app  (Netlify default)
#   - http://localhost:8080            (local dev)
#
# For production deploys, set the same value in
#   Netlify → site settings → environment variables → VITE_MOONBASE_URL
# and trigger a fresh deploy (env changes do not retroactively rebuild).
VITE_MOONBASE_URL=
